{
 "id": "bigville_land_tenure",
 "version": "1.0.0",
 "depends_on": [],
 "self_load_only": true,
 "description": "BIGVILLE R13 (block 261000) -- LAND AS THE ROOT of tenure / construction / collateral, and the STRUCTURAL levers. bl_build (construction REQUIRES owning the plot -- the R12 precondition) + bl_build_trespass (building on ANOTHER'S land is refused = trespass; unowned frontier matches neither -> built stays 0, refusal as absence). bl_foreclose_land grounds R7's PROXIED land-as-collateral: it keys off R7's OWN `foreclosed` flag (R7 decided, over the house) and MOVES the `owns` edge of the plot the same mortgage is `secured_on_plot` from debtor to bank -- foreclosure transfers the LAND. The structural levers that reopen land to the landless: bl_land_tax (the GEORGIST per-plot tax to the jurisdiction) + bl_tax_forfeit (can't pay -> the plot forfeits to the council, the redistribution source) + bl_enclosure_reversal (owned plot -> unowned frontier commons, re-claimable). Every plot transfer MOVES an `owns` edge; no Plot node is minted or destroyed (Sigma conserved). Composes existing DSL Terms; ZERO new Rust.",
 "nodes": [],
 "edges": [],
 "productions": [],
 "concepts": [],
 "rules": [
  {
   "name": "bl_build",
   "batch": false,
   "match": [
    [
     "builder",
     "wants_to_build",
     "plot"
    ],
    [
     "builder",
     "owns",
     "plot"
    ]
   ],
   "where": {
    "type": "Eq",
    "a": {
     "type": "Plus",
     "items": [
      {
       "type": "Attr",
       "node": {
        "type": "Var",
        "name": "plot"
       },
       "key": "built"
      },
      {
       "type": "Lit",
       "value": 0.0
      }
     ]
    },
    "b": {
     "type": "Lit",
     "value": 0.0
    }
   },
   "effects": [
    [
     "set_attr",
     "plot",
     "built",
     1.0
    ],
    [
     "del_edge",
     "builder",
     "wants_to_build",
     "plot"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "name": "bl_build_trespass",
   "batch": false,
   "match": [
    [
     "builder",
     "wants_to_build",
     "plot"
    ],
    [
     "owner",
     "owns",
     "plot"
    ]
   ],
   "where": {
    "type": "Not",
    "arg": {
     "type": "Eq",
     "a": {
      "type": "Var",
      "name": "builder"
     },
     "b": {
      "type": "Var",
      "name": "owner"
     }
    }
   },
   "effects": [
    [
     "set_attr",
     "builder",
     "trespass",
     1.0
    ],
    [
     "del_edge",
     "builder",
     "wants_to_build",
     "plot"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "name": "bl_foreclose_land",
   "batch": false,
   "match": [
    [
     "debtor",
     "owns",
     "plot"
    ],
    [
     "mort",
     "secured_on_plot",
     "plot"
    ],
    [
     "bank",
     "issued",
     "mort"
    ]
   ],
   "where": {
    "type": "And",
    "items": [
     {
      "type": "Eq",
      "a": {
       "type": "Plus",
       "items": [
        {
         "type": "Attr",
         "node": {
          "type": "Var",
          "name": "mort"
         },
         "key": "foreclosed"
        },
        {
         "type": "Lit",
         "value": 0.0
        }
       ]
      },
      "b": {
       "type": "Lit",
       "value": 1.0
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "Eq",
      "a": {
       "type": "Plus",
       "items": [
        {
         "type": "Attr",
         "node": {
          "type": "Var",
          "name": "mort"
         },
         "key": "land_transferred"
        },
        {
         "type": "Lit",
         "value": 0.0
        }
       ]
      },
      "b": {
       "type": "Lit",
       "value": 0.0
      }
     }
    ]
   },
   "effects": [
    [
     "set_attr",
     "mort",
     "land_transferred",
     1.0
    ],
    [
     "del_edge",
     "debtor",
     "owns",
     "plot"
    ],
    [
     "add_edge",
     "bank",
     "owns",
     "plot"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "name": "bl_land_tax",
   "batch": false,
   "match": [
